             13  *
             14  * ABSTRACT:
             15  *
             16  *       PERFORM 'AND' FUNCTION ON TWO OPERANDS
             17  *       AND RETURN A VALUE OF 1 OR 0 ACCORDINGLY.
             18  *
             19  *
             20  * CALLING SEQUENCE:
             21  *
             22  *       BL @ANDF
             23  *
             24  *       IN (R1) = OPERAND 1
             25  *          (R2) = OPERAND 2
             26  *
             27  *       OUT (R2) = 1 OR 0 IN FPAC
             28  *
             29  *      NORMAL EXIT - RETURN
             30  *
