             82  * ABSTRACT:
             83  *
             84  *       PERFORM A 'NOT' FUNCTION ON THE OPERAND
             85  *
             86  * CALLING SEQUENCE:
             87  *
             88  *       BL @NOTF
             89  *
             90  *       IN (R1) = OPERAND
             91  *
             92  *       OUT (R2) = 1 OR 0 IN FPAC
             93  *
             94  *
     0031'   95  NOTF   EQU  $+1               ;INDICATE AS UNARY OPERATION
